  "description": "Runs any VpnHood Avalonia UI as a browser page: the app's web host serves it to a paired device, and the page dials the app's API over HTTP. Names no UI; a page project names one (AvaloniaBrowserHost.RunAsync) and imports build/*.props for the WebAssembly settings.",
